<title>HONG KONG: Salomon amends terms on China Res warrant.</title>
<headline>Salomon amends terms on China Res warrant.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc said it amended the issue price and strike price of its issue of 140 million call warrants on shares of China Resources Enterprise Ltd to HK$0.3608 and HK$13.55 respectively, from the previous HK$0.3595 and HK$13.50.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$13.55</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.3608</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  20.MAR.98</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> LISTING DATE	23.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  WITH ISSUER'S CASH OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
